@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantPadding 20
    BoxPadding 10
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    ActorBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ActorBorderColor #1565C0
    BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BoundaryBorderColor #E65100
    ControlBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    ControlBorderColor #2E7D32
    EntityBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    EntityBorderColor #6A1B9A
    MessageArrowColor #555555
    MessageFontSize 12
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
    NoteBorderColor #F9A825
}

actor "Usuario" as User
boundary "DiaryFragment" as Diary
control "TaskViewModel" as VM
entity "TaskRepository" as Repo
database "Room DB\n(TaskDao, CompletionDao)" as DB
control "NotificationScheduler" as Notif
boundary "Android\nAlarmManager" as Alarm

== Inicio de la App (MainActivity) ==
User -> Diary : Abre app (MainActivity host)
Diary -> VM : getActiveTasks().observe()
VM -> Repo : getActiveTasks()
Repo -> DB : TaskDao.getActiveTasks() [LiveData]
DB --> Repo : LiveData<List<Task>>
Repo --> VM : LiveData<List<Task>>
VM --> Diary : LiveData emitido
Diary -> Diary : filterTasksForDay(hoy)
Diary -> VM : getCompletionsByDate(hoy).observe()
VM -> Repo : getCompletionsByDate(hoy)
Repo -> DB : CompletionDao.getCompletionsByDate(hoy) [LiveData]
DB --> Repo : LiveData<List<DailyCompletion>>
Repo --> VM : LiveData<List<DailyCompletion>>
VM --> Diary : LiveData emitido
Diary -> Diary : adapter.setCompletions() -> render lista

== Usuario marca tarea completada (SOLO hoy) ==
User -> Diary : Click checkbox en tarea
Diary -> VM : setCompletion(taskId, hoy, true)
VM -> Repo : upsertCompletion(DailyCompletion)
Repo -> DB : CompletionDao.insert() [background thread]
DB --> Repo : OK (upsert por unique index taskId|date)
Repo -> Notif : (nada, solo persistencia)
Repo --> VM : callback/void
VM --> Diary : LiveData CompletionDao.getCompletionsByDate(hoy) emite nuevo valor
Diary -> Diary : adapter.setCompletions() -> checkbox checked

note right of Diary
Solo se permite marcar/desmarcar
el día de HOY (editable=true).
Días pasados/futuros: checkbox
apagado (alpha=0.4), solo lectura.
end note

== Navegación a otro día (selector Lunes-Domingo) ==
User -> Diary : Click botón día (ej. Miércoles)
Diary -> Diary : selectDay(3)
Diary -> VM : setSelectedDay(3)
Diary -> Diary : filterTasksForDay(3)
Diary -> Diary : getDateForDay(3) -> "2026-07-08"
Diary -> VM : getCompletionsByDate("2026-07-08").observe()
VM -> Repo : getCompletionsByDate("2026-07-08")
Repo -> DB : CompletionDao.getCompletionsByDate() [LiveData]
DB --> Repo : LiveData
Repo --> VM : LiveData
VM --> Diary : LiveData emitido
Diary -> Diary : adapter.setCompletions() -> render histórico
Diary -> Diary : adapter.setEditable(false) -> checkboxes disabled

@enduml